msgstr "Checkout clásico de WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:586
msgid "Block-based checkout (Cart & Checkout blocks)"
msgstr "Checkout basado en bloques (Bloques de Carrito y Checkout)"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:588
